 "_construction": "Talking Hedz's construction at 14th order. Two SPANNING ends (S1 zero far below its pole so it rises; S7 zero far above at r=1.0 so it falls with a hard null) carry the envelope. Five CONTAINED voices sit between them, each zero +4 st above its own pole. facts.py CONTAINED_SECTION_PCT / SPANNING_SECTION_PCT.",
